(This independent local tool runs checks on demand\073 it does not provide scheduled monitoring\054 automatic alert) Tj
T*
(delivery\054 hosted uptime tracking or a distributed runner\056 Its path\057type rules are narrower than full JSON Schema\056) Tj
T*
(HTTP requests are bounded by time and size limits\054 and response bodies remain in the local database\056 Remote) Tj
T*
(endpoints require opt\055in\056 The optional bearer token is shared across configured endpoints\054 so authenticated use) Tj
T*
(requires trusted destinations\056 Public deployment needs access controls\054 retention decisions and further) Tj
T*
(operational hardening\056) Tj
